error[double-include]: `include("./geometry.jl")` includes file again
 --> positive.jl:4:1
  |
2 | include("geometry.jl")
  | ---------------------- first included here
3 | include("solvers.jl")
4 | include("./geometry.jl")
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ second copy of every definition
  |
  = why: methods are redefined and structs error or shadow; load order then decides behavior
  = fix: include each file once, from package entry file   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain double-include
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow double-include -- <reason>`

